{
  "$note": "Design System 的名字、命名空间、资产分组和打包。资产取自本方案 marks/（按 manifest 的 id；贴纸和插图用 build:marks 按蓝笔浅色上好色的 themed 版，App 图标和菜单栏用导出的 PNG，界面小图标用源文件）。bundle：把 tooling/ 里手画零件的模块原样打包成 components/bundle.js（站主 2026-11-07 定），params 是画法的数值。上传记录在 published.json。",
  "title": "Pomelo 柚儿园",
  "namespace": "Pomelo",
  "by": "Elen Skye",
  "via": "Claude Code · visual-atelier",
  "bundle": {
    "modules": [
      "tooling/handmade/line.mjs",
      "tooling/handmade/frame.mjs",
      "tooling/handmade/sticker.mjs",
      "tooling/handmade/paint.mjs"
    ],
    "params": "tokens/handmade.json",
    "$presets": "框的预设：data-hand 写名字就按它画（Pomelo.paint）。数值取自 Phase 2 小样（canvases/pomelo-explore/p2-final/），圆角跟 tokens 的 radius-*：卡片 14、纸 10、按钮 9–10、输入框 11。",
    "presets": {
      "frame": {},
      "card": {
        "r": 14,
        "amp": 0.95,
        "sw": 1.9,
        "tex": true
      },
      "sheet": {
        "r": 10,
        "amp": 1.1,
        "sw": 1.9,
        "tex": true,
        "stitches": true
      },
      "note": {
        "r": 4,
        "stroke": "none"
      },
      "desk": {
        "r": 0,
        "stroke": "none",
        "tex": true
      },
      "button": {
        "r": 9,
        "amp": 0.55,
        "sw": 1.6,
        "pad": 4,
        "fill": "primary"
      },
      "field": {
        "r": 11,
        "amp": 0.6,
        "sw": 1.6,
        "pad": 4,
        "fill": "card"
      },
      "round": {
        "r": "half",
        "amp": 0.6,
        "sw": 1.5,
        "pad": 4,
        "fill": "card"
      },
      "cell": {
        "r": 12,
        "amp": 0.8,
        "sw": 1.6
      },
      "pick": {
        "r": 9,
        "amp": 0.8,
        "pad": 0,
        "stroke": "none",
        "fill": "selected"
      },
      "ticket": {
        "r": 6,
        "stroke": "none"
      }
    }
  },
